# Vercel's CLI upload does NOT automatically honor .gitignore -- without
# this file, it tried to upload the full local directory, anchor/target/
# (2.1GB of Rust/Solana build output, irrelevant to the Next.js app)
# included, which is what saturated the connection on the first attempt.
# None of this is needed server-side: Vercel reinstalls node_modules
# itself, and the Anchor program isn't part of the Next.js build.

anchor/target/
anchor/.anchor/
node_modules/
.next/
.git/
test-ledger/
